-## Subtopics
+**Parameters:**
+*   **dims:** Voxel grid dimensions. Typical: $[64, 64, 64]$ [S2, unofficial].
+*   **displayMin/Max:** Range for the transfer function. Typical: $0$ to $500$ [S2, unofficial].
+*   **opacity:** Global volume opacity. Typical: $0.4$ [S2, unofficial].
